  "description": "The schema refers outside itself for the lei attribute, by a URL, and the ACDC is presented expanded, so the reference is on the path its attributes are validated along. Line 206 forbids such references in a schema, a rule for schema authors. The bundle also holds a document whose $id is that URL and which the lei value satisfies, so an implementation that resolves the reference from what it is given accepts the ACDC and fails the case; only refusing the reference passes. An adapter fetches nothing (docs/adapter-protocol.md, acdc.verify). Its positive pair is KS-02 (ACDC-0002), which differs from it only in the defect.",
